<h1 class="page-title">Delivery Policy</h1>
<div style="line-height:1.8;">
<h3>Delivery Time</h3><p>We strive to deliver within <strong>1-2 weeks</strong> of order placement. Delivery time may vary based on your location.</p>
<h3>Delivery Charges</h3><p>A flat delivery charge applies to all locations. Orders above the free delivery threshold qualify for free delivery.</p>
<h3>Delivery Process</h3><p>Our delivery personnel will contact you before delivery. You can pay online or via Cash on Delivery.</p>
<h3>Tracking</h3><p>Track your order status from your Orders page. You will receive updates as your order progresses.</p>
<h3>Delivery Areas</h3><p>We currently deliver across India. Certain remote locations may experience longer delivery times.</p>
</div></div>
